{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-515e68668fde","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-515e68668fde","name":"燕麦鸡蛋饼","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A6%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E9%A5%BC.md","blob_sha":"c83906d94f0a55d0a836251a4eeb43000467baec","details":{"introduction":"燕麦鸡蛋饼是一道快手营养早餐，口感软嫩，带有燕麦的谷物香气与蛋奶的醇厚，属于家常简约风格。富含蛋白质、碳水化合物和膳食纤维，能为身体提供充足能量，尤其适合健身人士和工作日早晨。做法简单，对新手友好，从备料到出锅通常只需十几分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 燕麦\n- 牛奶 50-100g，能够将燕麦搅拌粘稠即可\n- 可根据口味选择增加 50g 蔬菜，如菠菜。"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 鸡蛋两个，亦可选择两个蛋清，一个蛋黄。\n- 纯干燕麦片 50g （大约等同一个鸡蛋的量）\n- 牛奶一盒 约 250ml\n- 蔬菜碎叶一把"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将牛奶与干燕麦混合搅拌均匀至黏稠状。\n2. 将鸡蛋搅拌均匀至颜色单一程度。\n3. 将鸡蛋液倒入燕麦牛奶中继续搅拌至黏稠、均匀。\n4. 平底锅中加入一层黄油并覆盖均匀。\n5. 下入搅拌好的食材，并摊开至饼状。\n6. 小火加热两到三分钟。如想要加入蔬菜，可以在加热过程中加入碎菜叶。\n7. 翻面继续加热两分钟。\n8. 出锅，搭配剩下的牛奶作为早餐。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 如果口味偏咸口，可以在搅拌鸡蛋液时加入盐，胡椒等调料。\n- 煎饼时使用小火，避免燕麦部分煎糊。\n\n### 营养成分\n\n一份上述早餐的预估营养价值（三大营养素）如下，供热爱健身人群参考*。\n\n- 碳水化合物：39g\n- 蛋白质：30g\n- 脂肪：19g\n- 总热量：450kcal\n\n*： 牛奶按照常见的 250ml 计算"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：干普通燕麦80g、净全鸡蛋液150g、大豆食用油8g、食盐2g；整份约230g。普通干燕麦，非燕麦麸，不加其他可选配料。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":255.834783,"protein_g":12.808696,"carbohydrate_g":24.017391,"fat_g":11.948261},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients","version":"9a79148cfa005e95","fdc_ids":[173904,171287,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-515e68668fde-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-515e68668fde","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-515e68668fde","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-515e68668fde-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"oats_dry","grams":80},{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":8},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"9a79148cfa005e95","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-515e68668fde-v1.d8f82d5f93d6fb51.json","bytes":20670,"sha256":"d8f82d5f93d6fb511263ff80db3f041e53e0fa8c205887b5fae394b8c8b72ab1"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-515e68668fde-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-515e68668fde","recipe_blob_sha":"c83906d94f0a55d0a836251a4eeb43000467baec","version":"1","data_version":"9a79148cfa005e95","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":230,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品230g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：干普通燕麦80g、净全鸡蛋液150g、大豆食用油8g、食盐2g；整份约230g。普通干燕麦，非燕麦麸，不加其他可选配料。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-515e68668fde","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-515e68668fde-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"oats_dry","grams":80},{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":8},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":255.834783,"protein_g":12.808696,"carbohydrate_g":24.017391,"fat_